canvas 460 280
label "Mode 2, live specifications: a project's own decisions, specs (highlighted), tasks, gates, episodes and boards live in one Bundle, joined by the five engineering links, and the Bundle exports steer files for coding agents"
caption "The highlighted specs are ordinary items: decided by decision items, implemented by tasks, verified by gates, all inside one Bundle."
region bundle 16 20 428 170 "the project's own Bundle"
box dec 30 36 96 40 "decisions"
box spec 182 36 96 40 "specs" acc
box task 334 36 96 40 "tasks"
box gate 30 110 96 40 "gates"
box epi 182 110 96 40 "episodes"
box board 334 110 96 40 "boards"
arrow spec dec
text 154 50 "decided-by" size=10
arrow task spec
text 306 50 "implements" size=10
arrow gate spec
arrow epi gate dashed
text 154 124 "runs" size=10
arrow task board
text 376 96 "as a board" size=10 right
box steer 120 206 220 36 "steer files for coding agents"
arrow bundle steer
note "the same format, holding a project's own decisions, specs, tasks and gates"
